note mm: o[M,N] = a[M,K] @ b[K,N] (aten.mm), row-major f32. Each dot product is summed in f64 and
note rounded once to f32. The caller supplies const lines M K N MK KN MN before this text.
fn mmdot a view f32 MK b view f32 KN i ulong j ulong to f64
s = 0.0f64
ia = mul i K
rb = j
for k ulong K
s = add s mul f64 get a ia f64 get b rb
ia = add ia 1
rb = add rb N
end
ret s
end
fn mm a view f32 MK b view f32 KN o edit f32 MN to void
for i ulong M
for j ulong N
put o add mul i N j f32 mmdot a b i j
end
end
end
